<title>MALAYSIA: Australia not trying to squeeze Malaysia - Downer.</title>
<headline>Australia not trying to squeeze Malaysia - Downer.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Foreign Minister Alexander Downer said on Friday his country was not engaged in any plan to squeeze Malaysia out of the South Pacific.</p>
<p>&quot;We have absolutely no intention of wanting to freeze Malaysia out of the South Pacific region, in fact, quite the contrary,&quot; he told reporters upon arrival at the ASEAN regional forum meeting.</p>
</text>
